@huaqing/dsh-token-usage-dashboard README · Install the Edge bridge once：The extension runs only on `platform.deepseek.com` and posts only to
`127.0.0.1:17654`. It does not export cookies or the Platform user token to
another server.

@huaqing/dsh-token-usage-dashboard README · Contributing：Open an issue before changing a data source or the official collector, then run
`npm test`. See [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md) for the scope and security
checklist.

